{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25914","headline":"荐冰 · 陈至","name":"荐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凌寒开涸沍，寝庙致精诚。\n色静澄三酒，光寒肃两楹。\n形盐非近进，玉豆爲潜英。\n礼自春分展，坚从北陆成。\n藉茅心共结，出监水渐明。\n幸得来观荐，灵台一小生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}